<title>CHILE: RESEARCH ALERT - Endesa  cut to sell.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Endesa  cut to sell.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said on Thursday it had cut its rating for Chile's Empresa Nacional de Electricidad, or Endesa, to sell from hold.</p>
</text>
